            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某個 App 執行時…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is on, MacHelper keeps recording history in the background after you quit the app. Process usage history is still recorded even when no menu bar items are selected, as long as Record process usage is on in Data management. macOS may ask you to allow MacHelper in Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟後，即使結束 MacHelper，仍會在背景繼續記錄歷史。只要「資料管理」中的「記錄程序用量」保持開啟，即使沒有選取任何選單列項目，仍會記錄程序用量歷史。macOS 可能會要求你在「登入項目」中允許 MacHelper。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While %@ is running": {
      "localizations": {
