            "value": "感測器與核心歷史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose sensors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇感測器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature sensors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "溫度感測器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU core clusters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU 核心群組"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last seen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最後出現"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No longer reporting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已不再回報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sensor or core history yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚無感測器與核心歷史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose at least one sensor to show history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請至少選擇一個感測器來顯示歷史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records one average per minute for every temperature sensor and CPU core cluster from the CPU and temperature samples. This adds several dozen rows per minute, so leave it off unless you need the detail. The switch applies to MacHelper and to background recording, but it needs the matching CPU or temperature menu bar item to be on. Turning this off stops new sensor and core sampling. Stored history stays until the next recording removes samples past the retention, or until you clear it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每分鐘從 CPU 與溫度取樣中，為每個溫度感測器與 CPU 核心群組記錄一筆平均值。開啟後每分鐘會增加數十列資料，不需要細節時請保持關閉。這個開關同時適用於 MacHelper 與背景記錄，但需要開啟對應的 CPU 或溫度選單列項目。關閉後會停止新的感測器與核心取樣。已儲存的歷史會保留到下一次記錄移除超過保留期限的資料，或由你清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes every stored sensor temperature and CPU core cluster history. It can’t be undone. Monitoring history, process history, settings, and the operation history are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會永久刪除所有已儲存的感測器溫度與 CPU 核心群組歷史，無法復原。監控歷史、程序歷史、設定與操作歷史都不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Individual sensor temperatures and CPU core use are recorded once a minute. Turn on Record sensor and core usage in Settings → General → Data management, then check back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "個別感測器溫度與 CPU 核心用量每分鐘記錄一次。請在「設定」→「一般」→「資料管理」開啟「記錄感測器與核心用量」，稍後再回來查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes every stored process name, its CPU use, and its memory use. It can’t be undone. Monitoring history, sensor and core history, settings, and the operation history are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會永久刪除所有已儲存的程序名稱、CPU 用量與記憶體用量，無法復原。監控歷史、感測器與核心歷史、設定與操作紀錄都不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t save the process usage setting: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法儲存程序用量設定：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t clear process usage history: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法清除程序用量歷史：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Process history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序歷史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only each minute’s top 10 processes by CPU and by memory are kept, so a process missing from a minute may still have been running. Averages cover only the minutes a process appears in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每分鐘只保留 CPU 與記憶體用量前 10 名的程序，因此某分鐘沒出現的程序，當時可能仍在執行。平均值只計算該程序實際出現的分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to %lld processes per minute couldn’t be read and are not included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每分鐘最多有 %lld 個程序無法讀取，未列入排行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No process history yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有程序歷史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Process rankings appear after a minute of recording. Turn on Record process usage in Settings → General → Data management, then check back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始記錄滿一分鐘後就會出現程序排行。請在設定 → 一般 → 資料管理開啟「記錄程序用量」，再回來查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No data in this range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個時間範圍沒有資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld / %lld 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the process name, CPU use, and memory are recorded. Paths, command-line arguments, and user names are never saved. Process history follows the retention above and can be cleared at any time. The switch applies to MacHelper and to background recording; background recording keeps collecting process history even when no menu bar items are selected. Turning this off stops new process history sampling. Stored history stays until the next recording removes samples past the retention, or until you clear it. This switch only controls history recording; the live process list on the Monitor screen is not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只記錄程序名稱、CPU 用量與記憶體用量，不會儲存路徑、命令列參數或使用者名稱。程序歷史與上方設定的保留期限相同，而且可以隨時清除。這個開關同時適用於 MacHelper 與背景記錄；即使沒有選取任何選單列項目，背景記錄仍會收集程序歷史。關閉後會停止新的程序歷史取樣。已儲存的歷史會保留到下一次記錄移除超過保留期限的資料，或由你清除。這個開關只控制歷史記錄；監控畫面的即時程序列表不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alert thresholds and cooldown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知門檻與冷卻時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
