    "Importing replaces each category marked “Will replace”. Categories that aren’t in the file are left as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入時會取代標示「將被取代」的類別。檔案中沒有的類別不會變動。"
          }
