    },
    "Review what each category will do. Nothing changes until you choose Apply Import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認每個類別會做什麼。在你選擇「套用匯入」之前，不會變更任何設定。"
          }
        }
