            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將被取代"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cleaning whitelist and extra purge folders are replaced as a whole list. Comments and blank lines in the current text files aren’t kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理白名單與額外清除資料夾會整份取代。目前文字檔中的註解與空行不會保留。"
