            "value": "有點緊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Titles and big numbers use the display font; descriptions and lists use the text font so they stay easy to read. The pixel font is 俐方體11號 (Cubic 11), free to use and bundled with MacHelper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "標題和大數字使用標題字體；說明與清單使用內文字體，保持好讀。像素字體是 MacHelper 內附的免費字體「俐方體11號」。"
          }
