          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇要在哪裡建立「MacHelper Icons」資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click an icon to replace it with your own image; replaced icons are used with every set. An icon pack is a folder of images named after the icons (cpu.png, fans.svg …); export the template to see every name. Images in a pack that MacHelper doesn’t use are ignored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下圖示就能換成你自己的圖片，換過的圖示在任何圖示組都會使用。圖示包是一個資料夾，裡面的圖片以圖示代號命名（cpu.png、fans.svg…）；匯出範本可以看到所有代號。資料夾裡 MacHelper 用不到的檔案會被略過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete This Icon Pack": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
