    "Clear Filters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除篩選"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing matches the filters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有符合篩選條件的項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items, showing the first 500": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共 %lld 個項目，顯示前 500 個"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never Clean This": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永不清理這個項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never Clean": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永不清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHelper skips these files and folders, and everything inside them, when cleaning, uninstalling and moving disk analysis items to the Trash. Right-click an item in the preview and choose Never Clean This to add it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理、解除安裝，以及從磁碟分析移到垃圾桶時，MacHelper 都會略過這些檔案和資料夾（包含裡面的所有內容）。在預覽中對項目按右鍵，選「永不清理這個項目」就能加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean this again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing excluded yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有排除任何項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path or pattern, e.g. ~/Library/Caches/com.example.*": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路徑或萬用字元，例如 ~/Library/Caches/com.example.*"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Files or Folders…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇檔案或資料夾…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved in clean-whitelist.txt, also used by the command-line tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存放在 clean-whitelist.txt，命令列工具也會使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Tools": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let MacHelper see the whole disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓 MacHelper 看見整個磁碟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides some folders from apps until you allow it. Without Full Disk Access, MacHelper can’t measure or clean Mail downloads, some app caches and other protected places, and disk analysis misses them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 會對 App 隱藏部分資料夾，直到你允許為止。沒有「完全取用磁碟」權限，MacHelper 無法計算或清理郵件下載、部分 App 快取和其他受保護的位置，磁碟分析也會漏掉它們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Click Open System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 按「打開系統設定」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Turn on MacHelper in the Full Disk Access list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 在「完全取用磁碟」列表中打開 MacHelper。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Come back here. MacHelper checks again by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 回到這裡，MacHelper 會自動重新檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已開啟「完全取用磁碟」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未開啟「完全取用磁碟」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHelper only reads these folders to show you what can be cleaned. Nothing is removed without your confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHelper 只會讀取這些資料夾，列出可以清理的項目；沒有你的確認，什麼都不會刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍後再說"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps you installed with Homebrew that have a newer version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 Homebrew 安裝、有新版本可用的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include apps that update themselves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含會自動更新的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also list apps such as browsers that normally install their own updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也列出瀏覽器這類平常會自己安裝更新的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新檢查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew isn’t installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未安裝 Homebrew"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This page updates apps installed with Homebrew (brew install --cask). Install Homebrew from brew.sh to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一頁會更新用 Homebrew 安裝的 App（brew install --cask）。請先到 brew.sh 安裝 Homebrew。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open brew.sh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開 brew.sh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking for updates…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在檢查更新…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew couldn’t check for updates: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 無法檢查更新：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updated: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已更新：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates run brew upgrade --cask for each app, one at a time, and are recorded in the operation history. Apps that are open are quit first and reopened afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新會逐一對每個 App 執行 brew upgrade --cask，並記錄在操作紀錄中。開著的 App 會先結束，更新後再重新打開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Homebrew apps are up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有 Homebrew App 都是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps have updates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 %lld 個 App 可以更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@檢查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating %@ (%lld of %lld)…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
