        }
      }
    },
    "Open now, will be quit and reopened: %@. Save your work in them first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下 App 正開著，會先結束再重新打開：%@。請先儲存其中的工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t quit. Quit it yourself and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 沒有結束。請自行結束後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會自動更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinned": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已固定版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its installer needs your administrator password, which only Terminal can ask for:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的安裝程式需要管理者密碼，只能在「終端機」輸入："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷貝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開終端機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Homebrew said": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 的訊息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not updated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全性設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld could be safer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 項可以更安全"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHelper only reads these settings; it never changes them. Buttons open the matching page in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHelper 只會讀取這些設定，不會修改。按鈕會打開系統設定中對應的頁面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gatekeeper": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gatekeeper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps from unknown developers need your approval before they open the first time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "來自不明開發者的 App 第一次開啟前需要你同意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any downloaded app opens without a check. Turn it back on unless you need it off for a specific app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載的 App 開啟時不會被檢查。除非某個 App 需要，否則建議重新開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks downloaded apps before they open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在下載的 App 開啟前先檢查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FileVault disk encryption": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FileVault 磁碟加密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The startup disk is encrypted. Without your password nobody can read it, even with the disk removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟動磁碟已加密。沒有你的密碼，即使拆下磁碟也讀不到內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The startup disk isn’t encrypted: anyone who gets this Mac can read its files. Encrypting runs in the background while you keep working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟動磁碟沒有加密：任何拿到這台 Mac 的人都能讀取檔案。加密會在背景進行，不影響你繼續工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "進行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk is being encrypted or decrypted right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁碟正在加密或解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encrypts the startup disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加密啟動磁碟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Firewall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防火牆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incoming connections are filtered, and this Mac doesn’t answer probes from the network (stealth mode).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會過濾連入的連線，而且這台 Mac 不回應網路上的探測（隱形模式）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incoming connections to apps are filtered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會過濾連到 App 的連入連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps can accept connections from the network without asking. Worth turning on if you use public Wi-Fi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 可以不經詢問就接受網路連線。如果會使用公共 Wi-Fi，建議開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters incoming network connections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "過濾連入的網路連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Integrity Protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統完整性保護"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System files can’t be changed, not even by an administrator or malware with your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統檔案無法被修改，管理者或取得你密碼的惡意程式也不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System files can be changed. It can only be turned back on from macOS Recovery (csrutil enable).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統檔案可以被修改。只能在 macOS 復原模式中重新開啟（csrutil enable）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Partly on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some protections were turned off in macOS Recovery. They can only be restored there (csrutil enable).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分保護已在 macOS 復原模式中關閉，只能在那裡恢復（csrutil enable）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protects system files from changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保護系統檔案不被修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic security updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動安全性更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security responses and malware definitions install by themselves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全性回應和惡意軟體定義會自動安裝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security fixes and malware definitions don’t install by themselves. In Software Update → Automatic Updates, turn on “Install Security Responses and system files”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全性修正和惡意軟體定義不會自動安裝。請在「軟體更新 → 自動更新」中打開「安裝安全性回應和系統檔案」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only some security updates install by themselves. In Software Update → Automatic Updates, turn on “Install Security Responses and system files”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有部分安全性更新會自動安裝。請在「軟體更新 → 自動更新」中打開「安裝安全性回應和系統檔案」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs security fixes by themselves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動安裝安全性修正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XProtect malware definitions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XProtect 惡意軟體定義"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS’s built-in malware scanner. Definitions installed %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 內建的惡意軟體掃描。定義檔安裝於 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS’s built-in malware scanner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 內建的惡意軟體掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grew %@ since %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自 %2$@ 以來增加了 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grew %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增加了 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unusually large cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快取異常龐大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unusually large logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記錄檔異常龐大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ files directly inside": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裡面直接放了 %@ 個檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not used since %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自 %@ 起沒有使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of the folder shown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "占目前顯示的資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggestions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建議"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bloated folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "異常膨脹的資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mostly %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主要是 %1$@（%2$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not used for %lld days (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超過 %lld 天沒有使用（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan a location to find big files that look unused and folders that look bloated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描一個位置後，這裡會列出看起來用不到的大檔案和異常膨脹的資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing stands out: no big file unused for half a year, no oversized cache or log folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有發現異常：沒有半年沒用的大檔案，也沒有過大的快取或記錄檔資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let your AI agents use MacHelper": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓你的 AI Agent 使用 MacHelper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacHelper can add a skill to the coding agents on this Mac. With it, you can ask the agent things like “free up some space” or “why is my Mac hot?”, and it runs MacHelper’s command-line tool to check. It always shows you what it would remove and asks before removing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacHelper 可以替這台 Mac 上的程式碼 Agent 加入一個 Skill。裝好之後，你可以直接問 Agent「幫我清出一些空間」或「為什麼 Mac 這麼燙？」，它會用 MacHelper 的命令列工具檢查。要刪除任何東西前，它都會先列出內容並詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also add the machelper command to Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同時把 machelper 指令加入終端機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can add or remove it later in Settings → General.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後也可以在「設定 → 一般」加入或移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skill for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的 Skill"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安裝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will update on next launch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次啟動時會更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another skill named machelper is there; left alone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有另一個名為 machelper 的 Skill，不會更動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent not found": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到這個 Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Claude Code or Codex check and clean up this Mac through the machelper command. It previews first and asks before removing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓 Claude Code 或 Codex 透過 machelper 指令檢查並清理這台 Mac。它會先預覽，刪除任何東西前都會詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
